            "sid": "2CH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Solomonini Waaqa kad'ate waan jed'e, Ee AABBO Waaqa, atini dumansaafi dukana fohate keesati galta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma tana anini yayu mana gudda dansa sii jaare, ka atini haga jiru jireenna keesati galtu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato biyyiti achi ejaanjitu Solomonini fuula worrati deefate, worra eebise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7.1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Od-dur 17.1-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Duuba inni waan jed'e, AABBO Waaqa Israeli ha guddisani. Inni yayu kakhu duri abba kiyya Dauditi kakhate guute. Gaafasi inni waan jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haguma gumi tiyya lafa Misiri keesaa baase, anini dira tokole lafa Israeli keesati fulla mana kiyya iti jaarani na kad'atani infohanne; ammalle anini nama worra kiyya ka Israelitini deemu infohanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo amma tana yayu dira Yerusalemu fohad'e, aka isa keesati na kad'atani, ammalle anini ya si fohad'e, Daudi, aka atini gumi tiyya fiddu jed'e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle Solomonini waan worraani jed'e, Abbaani kiyya, Daudini, duri herege, aka Mana AABBO, Waaqa Israeli, iti kad'atani jaaru; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammo AABBO Waaqi waan isaani jed'e, Heregi kanke sunini dansa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammo atini mana suni na injaartu, nami mana suni na jaaru ilmuma kanke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma tana AABBO Waaqi yayu kakhu ufi guute anini huji hayyuma abba kiyya iraa fuud'e, Mana AABBO Waaqa Israeli iti kad'atani yayu jaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle Mana suni keesa anini yayu Sanduqa Wold'aqisa, ka d'akha hahafalicha wold'aqisa AABBO Waaqi duri ababoota teennaani woliini tolfate, qabu, kaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kad'acha Solomonini kad'ate",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Solomonini gumi ch'ufa dura d'ufe, fulla sorio iti qalani eje, harka olfud'ate, Waaqa kad'ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Solomonini qara fulla ira ejani gumiti haasani sibiila diimani mid'aase, ballinna d'aatu Mana Waaqa kaye. Woni suni d'eerinni isii d'und'uma shani, ballinnileeni d'und'uma shani, old'eerinni d'und'uma sadi. Inni woni suni kore. Fulla nami ch'ufti dandae isa argu jilbifate, harka ufi olqabate.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni Waaqa kad'ate waan jed'e, Ee AABBO, Waaqa Israeli, Waaqi aka kanketi tokoleeni lafafi gubba injiru! Atini wold'aqisa gumi tante woliini tolfatte jabeesite. Jaalala tante worra garsiifta, hojja worri garaa tokooni si gula yau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini kakhu abba kiyya Dauditi kakhate yayu jabeesite; dubbini sunini ch'ufti arra yayu guutamte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Hay 2.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amma tana, Ee AABBO Waaqa Israeli, kakhu d'ibi atini abba kiyyati kakhate guuti, ta atini, haguma jiru jireenna, d'aloota kanke keesa, nami toko Israeli mohata, jette hojja gumiini tante aka inni Seera kanke guute, guutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi amma tana, ee Waaqa Israeli, waan atini abba kiyya Daudi hojattu tanteeti kakhatte ch'ufa guuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
